# CSP permissions for casbin.apache.org - approved by ASF Data Privacy on 2026-10-11 (privacy@apache.org, "CSP exception request for casbin.apache.org: giscus").
# giscus.app: GitHub Discussions comments under docs and blog posts, loaded only after the visitor clicks "Show comments".
SetEnv CSP_PROJECT_DOMAINS "https://giscus.app/"
